# The base-image build-args of build/agentry-browser/Dockerfile, each mapped to
# its upstream ref. scripts/build.sh replaces each with our digest-pinned
# mirror and refuses to build if the ref is not in images.tsv.
#
# UBUNTU_IMAGE is the image's base: plain Ubuntu 24.04, the release Playwright
# supports and Chrome for Testing's libraries come from (agentry-notes
# plans/browser-testing.md D5, as the operator revised it on 2026-10-13 after
# M1, agentry-cli#914). NODE_IMAGE is build-time only: it installs the
# server's packages from the lockfile, and its node binary (glibc, Node 24;
# Playwright needs 20 or later and noble's own is 18) is the only file the
# image takes from it.
UBUNTU_IMAGE=ubuntu:noble
NODE_IMAGE=node:24-bookworm-slim
